# Plan execution notes

When a Plan mode plan is **executed** (the user approved it and the work from that plan was written into the repo), append one entry to [notes.md](notes.md).

- Log only executed plans. Do not log plans that were only discussed, edited, or abandoned.
- Newest first, directly under the intro lines.
- Format: `## YYYY-MM-DD — <plan title>` plus 1–3 short bullets of what landed.
- Keep it basic. No transcripts, no rationale dumps, no extra log files, no timestamps to the second.
